WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.701
Mass stays the same everywhere. Weight is the pull of gravity on it.

2
00:00:05.477 --> 00:00:10.577
On Earth, a sixty kilogram astronaut weighs five hundred and eighty eight newtons.

3
00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:19.118
On the Moon she weighs ninety six newtons, but her mass is still sixty kilograms.

4
00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:26.938
Mass is the matter in her; weight is the force of gravity on it.
